{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers a glimpse of the core gameplay, but only includes part of the full content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only <strong>4 research projects</strong> are available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Academic rank is limited to the <strong>first three levels</strong> (Lecturer stage), with no further upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes only a portion of the student characters and furniture from the full version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo, you can:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit students and carry out research projects, experiencing the fun of academic management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage research resources to push projects forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get an initial feel for lab management and academic rank progression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Note:</strong> The features and content of this demo are for showcase purposes only and do not represent the complete experience of the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an idle simulation game that won\u2019t interrupt your work, experiments, or thesis writing. It quietly runs in a small corner of your screen\u2014always there, always supporting you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you play as a young lecturer just starting your academic career. Your mission is to build and lead your own research team\u2014conducting experiments, analyzing data, and publishing papers in scientific journals\u2014embarking on a challenging and rewarding journey through academia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Interview Students</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin from scratch by personally interviewing master's and PhD candidates. Select the most suitable students to join your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/85f1be1182aefcaae06150622917a445.poster.avif?t=1759962039\" width=1170 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/85f1be1182aefcaae06150622917a445.webm?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/85f1be1182aefcaae06150622917a445.mp4?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/0e3acfad00b2e1f1ee4272c5ffd0ba45.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Manage the Lab</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/0e3acfad00b2e1f1ee4272c5ffd0ba45.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Students may slack off occasionally. Conduct regular inspections by clicking to check their status\u2014motivate them, spark creativity, and reduce unproductive time. If a student consistently underperforms with little progress, you have the right to take action\u2014deny graduation and deliver the &quot;iron fist of research reality.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/f575d0c8ab654a7122236f5efb569f7c.poster.avif?t=1759962039\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/f575d0c8ab654a7122236f5efb569f7c.webm?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/f575d0c8ab654a7122236f5efb569f7c.mp4?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Purchase and Upgrade Lab Equipment</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve research efficiency by acquiring and upgrading equipment. Don\u2019t forget to add some entertainment facilities to relieve stress and prevent burnout. Transform your humble lab into a cutting-edge, intelligent research hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/170b11ebe5d8ece87c4a6acaada2816d.poster.avif?t=1759962039\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/170b11ebe5d8ece87c4a6acaada2816d.webm?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/170b11ebe5d8ece87c4a6acaada2816d.mp4?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/0e3acfad00b2e1f1ee4272c5ffd0ba45.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Publish Papers</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/0e3acfad00b2e1f1ee4272c5ffd0ba45.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your research is ready, write and submit papers to journals. The higher the quality, the more likely you are to get published in top-tier, high-impact journals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/9c9463cedfb7cee7a2532efe0d53bec5.poster.avif?t=1759962039\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/9c9463cedfb7cee7a2532efe0d53bec5.webm?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/9c9463cedfb7cee7a2532efe0d53bec5.mp4?t=1759962039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong>Climb the Academic Ladder</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/extras/718f9810f7a5ed8768892ae2bcabcec2.webp?t=1759962039\" width=32 height=32 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your influence grows, so will your academic rank\u2014from Lecturer, to Associate Professor, and eventually to a respected full Professor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hardships along the way? Only you will truly understand.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066760?t=1759962039","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066760?t=1759962039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/c723bffc6c71366aad75383a311679de7b5b7339/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759962039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066760/c723bffc6c71366aad75383a311679de7b5b7339/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759962039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo 